# "Whenever a Rat you control becomes blocked, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn" (CR 509.1h, 611.2a): Bot1's Muck Rats (1/1)
# attacks and Fortified Rampart (0/6, defender, can block) blocks it. The trigger resolves before combat damage, so the Rats
# deal 3 damage to the Rampart, and are back to 1 power on the next turn. The Rampart has 0 power, so the Rats survive.

